item.description:
1. How Society Runs on Credit First, let&rsquo;s do a Q&amp;A:
@ask:Why can you ride the bus with just a card?
@answer:Because I topped it up.
@ask:Money? Then where did your money come from?
@answer:My monthly salary.
@ask:Why does the company pay you a salary every month?
@answer:We signed a contract.
